{"translation":{"id":"kan_irv","name":"ಇಂಡಿಯನ್ ರಿವೈಜ್ಡ್ ವರ್ಸನ್ (IRV) - ಕನ್ನಡ - 2019","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanirv","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanirv","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Kannada Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"kan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"82cc741009376c81c4416c230a757b2e30ef49b2e4672f9831adcedfc26b865f","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31031,"languageName":"ಕನ್ನಡ","languageEnglishName":"Kannada"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"kan_irv","name":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","commonName":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","title":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08dbfe5ddc486dec386dace7278fb86473155bcc396458e2e5b52a02b2d0a830","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":113,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ಯೆಹೋವನನ್ನು ಸ್ತುತಿಸುವುದು"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವನಿಗೆ ಸ್ತೋತ್ರ!","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವನ ಸೇವಕರೇ, ಸ್ತೋತ್ರಮಾಡಿರಿ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವನ ನಾಮವನ್ನು ಸ್ತುತಿಸಿರಿ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಈಗಿನಿಂದ ಯುಗಯುಗಕ್ಕೂ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವನ ನಾಮವು ಕೀರ್ತಿಸಲ್ಪಡಲಿ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವನ ನಾಮವು ಪೂರ್ವದಿಂದ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಪಶ್ಚಿಮದವರೆಗೂ ಸ್ತುತಿಹೊಂದಲಿ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವನು ಎಲ್ಲಾ ಜನಾಂಗಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಮಹೋನ್ನತನು;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಆತನ ಪ್ರಭಾವವು ಮೇಲಣ ಲೋಕಕ್ಕಿಂತಲೂ ಉನ್ನತವಾಗಿದೆ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ನಮ್ಮ ಯೆಹೋವ ದೇವರಿಗೆ ಸಮಾನರು ಯಾರು?","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಆತನು ಉನ್ನತಲೋಕದಲ್ಲಿ ಆಸನಾರೂಢನಾಗಿ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಆಕಾಶವನ್ನೂ, ಭೂಮಿಯನ್ನೂ ನೋಡಲಿಕ್ಕೆ ಬಾಗುತ್ತಾನೆ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಆತನು ದೀನರನ್ನು ಧೂಳಿನಿಂದ ಎಬ್ಬಿಸಿ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಬಡವರನ್ನು ತಿಪ್ಪೆಯಿಂದ ಎತ್ತುತ್ತಾನೆ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಪ್ರಭುಗಳ ಜೊತೆಯಲ್ಲಿ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಅಂದರೆ ಅವರ ಜನಾಧಿಪತಿಗಳೊಡನೆ ಅವರನ್ನು ಕುಳ್ಳಿರಿಸುತ್ತಾನೆ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಬಂಜೆಯು ಮಕ್ಕಳೊಂದಿಗೆ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಸಂತೋಷದಿಂದ ಮನೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ವಾಸಿಸುವ ಹಾಗೆ ಮಾಡುತ್ತಾನೆ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವನಿಗೆ ಸ್ತೋತ್ರ!","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/113.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/114.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/112.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}